@startuml
!include 00-style.puml
top to bottom direction

node "浏览器客户端" as Browser {
  artifact "学生端/教师端页面"
}

node "网关节点\ngateway.jar" as GatewayNode {
  artifact "Spring Cloud Gateway"
}

node "服务注册与配置" as InfraNode {
  artifact "registry-server"
  artifact "config-server"
}

node "业务服务集群" as ServiceNode {
  artifact "auth-service.jar"
  artifact "user-service.jar"
  artifact "agent-service.jar"
  artifact "ai-service.jar"
  artifact "analysis-service.jar"
  artifact "notification-service.jar"
  artifact "course-service.jar"
  artifact "assignment-service.jar"
  artifact "exam-service.jar"
}

database "MySQL\nsc_auth/sc_user/sc_agent/\nsc_ai/sc_analysis/sc_notification/..." as MySQL
database "Redis" as Redis
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
collections "向量索引\nInMemoryRagIndex" as VectorIndex

Browser --> GatewayNode : HTTPS / API
GatewayNode --> InfraNode : 注册发现 / 配置拉取
GatewayNode --> ServiceNode : HTTP / Feign / LB
ServiceNode --> MySQL : JPA / MyBatis
ServiceNode --> Redis : 缓存 / 黑名单 / 会话辅助
ServiceNode --> MQ : 事件投递与消费
ServiceNode --> VectorIndex : RAG 检索

@enduml
